@@ -3,3 +3,19 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` (exported from `src/index.ts`) returns an in-memory rental service:
+
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })`: `kind` is `'board'` or `'sail'`; `dailyPrice` is an integer in euro cents.
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })`: returns `{ itemId, start, end, total }`.
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })`: returns `{ id, itemId, start, end, total }`; booking ids are sequential (`booking-1`, ...) so that runs are deterministic.
+
+Both throw for an unknown item or a period that is not whole days (`start` and `end` are ISO-8601 UTC strings at
+midnight, `end` being the start of the day after the last day, so it must be after `start`). `book` also throws if the
+item already has an overlapping booking; a booking ending the day another starts is fine.
+
+The cancellation policy (no refund less than 24 hours before the start, full refund otherwise) is not implemented yet.
+
+Run the tests with `npm test`.
